---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Driveway restoration & cleaning — Precision Surfacing Norfolk"
description: "Norfolk's driveway restoration specialists — jet washing, re-sanding and sealing. Three packages: Refresh, Renew and Restore. Restored, not replaced."
---
<section class="hero sc-hero" data-theme="dark">
  <div class="sc-hero-in">
    <div class="sc-hero-text">
      <span class="eyebrow">Driveway restoration · Norfolk</span>
      <h1>Driveway<br>restoration<br><em>specialists.</em></h1>
      <p class="sc-lede">Restored, not replaced — jet-washed, re-sanded and re-sealed to bring tired driveways, patios and paths back to their best, for a fraction of the cost of laying new.</p>
      <div class="sc-cta">
        <a class="sc-btn" href="/get-a-quote/">Get a free quote <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sc-hero-media">
      <div class="ba" style="--pos:52%">
        <div class="ba-img ba-after"><span class="ba-lab after">After</span></div>
        <div class="ba-img ba-before"><span class="ba-lab before">Before</span></div>
        <div class="ba-line"><span class="ba-grip"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 6l-4 6 4 6M15 6l4 6-4 6"/></svg></span></div>
        <input type="range" class="ba-range" min="0" max="100" value="52" aria-label="Drag to compare before and after">
      </div>
      <span class="ba-cap">← drag to see the difference →</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="section-fade section-fade--grain" style="--fade-to:#fff" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<!-- 01 REFRESH — text left / image right -->
<section class="pkg-row sc-white" id="packages">
  <div class="pkg-row-in">
    <div class="pkg-copy">
      <span class="pkg-n">01 — Refresh</span>
      <h2 class="pkg-h">Refresh<span> — the deep clean.</span></h2>
      <p class="pkg-desc">A powerful, controlled jet wash lifts years of dirt, moss, algae and weeds — instantly brightening block paving, slabs or concrete.</p>
      <ul class="pkg-list">
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Full pressure jet wash</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Weed, moss &amp; algae removal</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Clean rinse-down &amp; tidy-up</li>
        <li class="mut"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg>Re-sanding</li>
        <li class="mut"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg>Sealing</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="pkg-note">Best for surfaces that just need a freshen-up.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pkg-media"><span>Refresh · photo</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 02 RENEW — image left / text right -->
<section class="pkg-row sc-white">
  <div class="pkg-row-in rev">
    <div class="pkg-copy">
      <span class="pkg-n">02 — Renew</span>
      <h2 class="pkg-h">Renew<span> — cleaned &amp; re-locked.</span></h2>
      <p class="pkg-desc">Everything in Refresh, then fresh kiln-dried sand is brushed into every joint — re-locking the blocks, steadying the surface and slowing new weeds.</p>
      <ul class="pkg-list">
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Everything in Refresh</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Fresh kiln-dried jointing sand</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Joints re-locked &amp; stabilised</li>
        <li class="mut"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg>Sealing</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="pkg-note">Best for block paving that's lost its sand.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pkg-media"><span>Renew · photo</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 03 RESTORE — text left / image right -->
<section class="pkg-row sc-white">
  <div class="pkg-row-in">
    <div class="pkg-copy">
      <span class="pkg-n">03 — Restore</span>
      <h2 class="pkg-h">Restore<span> — colour back, sealed for years.</span></h2>
      <p class="pkg-desc">The full works: cleaned, re-sanded, then sealed with a protective coat that revives the original colour, repels stains and weeds, and shields the surface for years.</p>
      <ul class="pkg-list">
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Everything in Renew</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Colour-reviving sealer</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Weed &amp; stain resistance</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Years of protection</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="pkg-note">Our best — like-new, and it stays that way.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pkg-media"><span>Restore · photo</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="section-fade section-fade--up section-fade--grain" style="--fade-from:#fff" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="sc-sec sc-dark">
  <div class="sc-in sc-about-in">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">About us</span>
      <h2 class="dh">The team who <em>lay them.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="sc-about-body">
      <p>Precision Restorations is the surface-care side of Precision Surfacing — setting the standard across Norfolk, built on decades of hands-on experience passed down over four generations.</p>
      <p>We restore driveways, patios and paths to the same standard we build them. Because we know exactly how these surfaces are laid, we know exactly how to bring them back — the right pressure, the right sand, the right sealer, every time. Fully insured, done in-house, priced honestly.</p>
      <div class="sc-about-stats">
        <div><b>60-year</b><span>Regional legacy</span></div>
        <div><b>In-house</b><span>Never subcontracted</span></div>
        <div><b>Fully</b><span>Insured &amp; tidy</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- GET STARTED -->
<section class="sc-sec sc-dark sc-center">
  <div class="sc-in">
    <span class="kicker">Get started</span>
    <h2 class="dh">Ready when <em>you are.</em></h2>
    <p class="sc-seclede">Send us a few photos and we'll come back with an honest recommendation and a price — no obligation.</p>
    <div class="sc-cta-center">
      <a class="sc-btn" href="/get-a-quote/">Get a free quote <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set coverageDark = true %}
{% include "partials/areas.njk" %}

<style>
  /* ===== HERO ===== */
  .hero.sc-hero{background:var(--ink)}
  .sc-hero-in{padding-block:clamp(88px,13vh,140px) clamp(48px,9vw,104px);padding-inline:22px;
    position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}
  .sc-hero h1{font-size:clamp(46px,7vw,80px);color:#fff}
  .sc-lede{margin-top:24px;max-width:44ch;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66);font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.65}
  .sc-cta{display:flex;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-top:32px}
  .sc-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px;margin-top:30px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}
  .sc-trust b{color:#fff;font-weight:500}
  .sc-trust span{width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold)}

  /* buttons */
  .sc-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:15.5px;letter-spacing:.02em;background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;padding:15px 24px;text-decoration:none;transition:filter .2s ease,transform .15s ease}
  .sc-btn svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8}
  .sc-btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.06);transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .sc-btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);color:#fff}
  .sc-btn.ghost:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);filter:none;transform:none}
  .sc-cta-center{margin-top:32px;display:flex;justify-content:center}

  /* about us */
  .sc-about-in{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px;align-items:start}
  .sc-about-in .dh{color:#fff;margin-top:14px}
  .sc-about-body p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);font-size:16px;line-height:1.72;max-width:62ch}
  .sc-about-body p + p{margin-top:15px}
  .sc-about-stats{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px 34px;margin-top:28px}
  .sc-about-stats div{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .sc-about-stats b{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:26px;color:var(--gold-hl);line-height:1}
  .sc-about-stats span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);margin-top:6px}
  @media (min-width:900px){
    .sc-about-in{grid-template-columns:.82fr 1.18fr;gap:56px}
  }

  /* ===== BEFORE / AFTER SLIDER ===== */
  .sc-hero-media{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
  .ba{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;user-select:none;touch-action:pan-y;box-shadow:0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.6);isolation:isolate}
  .ba-img{position:absolute;inset:0;background-size:cover;background-position:center}
  /* placeholder textures — swap ba-after/ba-before backgrounds for real photos */
  .ba-after{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#dfe3db 0%,#c7ccc2 55%,#eef1ea 100%)}
  .ba-before{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#41443c 0%,#33362e 55%,#4c4f45 100%);clip-path:inset(0 calc(100% - var(--pos)) 0 0)}
  .ba-after.alt{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#e6e2d6 0%,#d3cdbb 55%,#f2eee2 100%)}
  .ba-before.alt{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#3d3a30 0%,#2f2c24 55%,#48443a 100%);clip-path:inset(0 calc(100% - var(--pos)) 0 0)}
  .ba-lab{position:absolute;bottom:14px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:100px;background:rgba(8,9,10,.6);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(4px);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
  .ba-lab.before{left:14px;color:#fff}
  .ba-lab.after{right:14px;color:#fff}
  .ba-line{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:var(--pos);width:2px;background:#fff;transform:translateX(-1px);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(0,0,0,.4);pointer-events:none;z-index:3}
  .ba-grip{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
  .ba-grip svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke:var(--ink);fill:none;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .ba-range{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;opacity:0;cursor:ew-resize;z-index:4}
  .ba-cap{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);text-align:center}
  .ba-mini{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mist);text-align:center}

  /* ===== SECTIONS ===== */
  .sc-sec{padding-block:clamp(56px,9vw,100px);padding-inline:22px}
  .sc-in{width:100%}
  .sc-light{background:var(--paper)}
  .sc-white{background:#fff}
  .sc-dark{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}
  .sc-center{text-align:center}
  .sc-center .kicker{justify-content:center}
  .sc-center .kicker::after{display:none}
  .sc-sec .dh{margin-top:14px}
  .sc-dark .dh{color:#fff}
  .sc-dark .kicker{color:rgba(255,255,255,.5)}
  .sc-dark .kicker::after{background:var(--line-d)}
  .sc-seclede{font-size:17px;color:#55585a;margin-top:16px;max-width:56ch}
  .sc-center .sc-seclede{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
  .sc-dark .sc-seclede{color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}

  /* packages */
  .pkgs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:52px;text-align:left;align-items:stretch}
  .pkg{border:1px solid var(--line-l);border-radius:20px;padding:34px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}
  .pkg:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 26px 50px -26px rgba(14,15,16,.32)}
  .pkg.feat{border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 26px 60px -30px rgba(200,145,43,.5);position:relative}
  .pkg-tag{position:absolute;top:-13px;left:30px;background:var(--gold-hl);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:100px}
  .pkg-n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-deep)}
  .pkg h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:34px;color:var(--ink);margin:8px 0 4px;line-height:1}
  .pkg-one{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:19px;color:#6b6e6b}
  .pkg-desc{font-size:14.5px;color:#55585a;margin:16px 0 22px;min-height:88px;line-height:1.6}
  .pkg-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin:0 0 26px;flex:1}
  .pkg-list li{display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--graphite)}
  .pkg-list li svg{width:18px;height:18px;flex:0 0 auto;stroke:var(--gold-deep);fill:none;stroke-width:2.4;margin-top:2px}
  .pkg-list li.mut{color:var(--mist)}
  .pkg-list li.mut svg{stroke:var(--mist)}
  .pkg-note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--mist);margin-bottom:18px}
  .pkg-btn{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-weight:600;transition:background .2s ease}
  .pkg-btn:hover{background:#000}
  .pkg-btn.gold{background:var(--gold-hl);color:var(--ink)}
  .pkg-btn.gold:hover{background:#F4D44A}

  /* package feature rows (alternating full-width) */
  .pkg-row{padding-block:clamp(44px,7vw,74px);padding-inline:22px}
  .pkg-row-in{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;align-items:center}
  .pkg-copy{max-width:520px}
  .pkg-copy .pkg-tag{position:static;display:inline-block;margin:0 0 12px}
  .pkg-h{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,46px);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.03;margin:3px 0 0}
  .pkg-h span{font-style:italic;color:#6b6e6b;font-size:.56em}
  .pkg-row .pkg-desc{min-height:0;margin:16px 0 20px;max-width:46ch}
  .pkg-media{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:16px;border:1px dashed var(--gold);background:rgba(230,178,62,.06);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .pkg-media span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-deep)}
  @media (min-width:900px){
    .pkg-row{padding-inline:max(48px,calc((100% - 1120px) / 2))}
    .pkg-row-in{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:64px}
    .pkg-row-in.rev .pkg-copy{order:2}
    .pkg-row-in.rev .pkg-media{order:1}
  }

  /* steps */
  .sc-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:46px;text-align:left}
  .sc-step{border-top:2px solid var(--gold);padding-top:20px}
  .sc-step .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--gold-deep);letter-spacing:.1em}
  .sc-step h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:23px;color:var(--ink);margin:8px 0 8px;line-height:1.1}
  .sc-step p{font-size:14.5px;color:#55585a;line-height:1.6}

  /* results grid */
  .sc-ba-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:46px}

  /* ===== DESKTOP: two-column hero ===== */
  @media (min-width:900px){
    .sc-hero-in{grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:56px}
    .sc-hero-in,.sc-sec{padding-inline:max(48px,calc((100% - 1120px) / 2))}
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){
    .sc-hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,11vw,60px)}
    .pkgs{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .pkg-desc{min-height:0}
    .sc-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .sc-ba-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  }
</style>

<script>
  (function(){
    document.querySelectorAll('.ba').forEach(function(ba){
      var r = ba.querySelector('.ba-range');
      if(!r) return;
      var apply = function(){ ba.style.setProperty('--pos', r.value + '%'); };
      r.addEventListener('input', apply);
      apply();
    });
  })();
</script>
